      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sofia, the agency receptionist, has invited her colleagues to see her act. Gabriel finally keeps his promise and watches her in a poetic stage play called Absence. After the performance, he walks out with her and tells her what he thought. Listen to their conversation in French.",
